  m_text: "The Sleep Experiment\u2122\n\nOriginal Idea - Tom\xE1s Real & Gon\xE7alo
    Ribeiro\n\nArtist Dep\r\n\r\nGon\xE7alo Ribeiro - 3D Artist\r\n\r\nTom\xE1s Real
    - 3D Artist\r\n\r\nGon\xE7alo Ribeiro - Environment Artist\r\n\r\nDevelopment
    Dep\r\n\r\nTom\xE1s Real - Game Dev  & Puzzle Dev\r\n\r\nGon\xE7alo Ribeiro -System
    Dev & Sound Dev\r\n\r\nDesign Dep\r\n\r\nTom\xE1s Real - Game Designer\r\n\r\nGon\xE7alo
    Ribeiro - Game Designer\r\n\nA game created by Silent Orbit Games Team and powered
    by ULHT\n\r\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\r\nCopyrights \xA92026 Silent Orbit Games, All
